        <p class="dui-hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/dui-defense.astro:r1f7g2">Washtenaw County DUI/OWI Drunk Driving Defense Lawyer Successful Defenses Of DUI Cases for Over 38 Years.</p>
